WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:28.825
Fictional Meridian teaching case. No course example grants workplace authority . Requests and unverified claims are not approvals. A colleague has read your corrected meeting message. What else would you check before saying the correction is complete? Receive and clarify. Agree a communication rhythm, approved channels and an alternative if the normal channel fails. Record practical work preferences, not personality labels or gossip. Acknowledge receipt without describing it as approval or completion.
